								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-primary-200 text-light\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><h1 style=\"text-align:center;\">Last two days for Registration Interviews<br>\nMonday, October 27th and Wednesday, October 29th!</h1>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><br>\n\t<strong>The Salvation Army Community Worship Center<br>\n\t940 Marsh Rd.<br>\n\tCharlotte, NC 28209<br>\n\t9:30am-3:30pm (BOTH DAYS)</strong></span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">AN IN-PERSON INTERVIEW IS REQUIRED TO RECEIVE CHRISTMAS ASSISTANCE.</span></strong>\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;\">Últimos dos días para las entrevistas de inscripción<br>\nLunes 27 y miércoles 29 de octubre!</h1>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>The Salvation Army Community Worship Center<br>\n\t940 Marsh Rd.<br>\n\tCharlotte, NC 28209<br>\n\t9:30am-3:30pm (AMBOS DÍAS</strong><strong>)</strong></span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">SE REQUIERE UNA ENTREVISTA EN PERSONA PARA RECIBIR ASISTENCIA DE NAVIDAD.</span></strong>\n</p></div>",
